+	/* Iscandar bridge, center 2.4's free door. The staged
+	 * text tested the address itself against the arena's
+	 * kernel mapping, but an address vfree() receives is
+	 * a vmalloc-range address with the arena's pages
+	 * mapped in, never an address inside that mapping,
+	 * so the staged test could not fire and the stock
+	 * body below would have freed the arena's pages to
