+	 * the area's first page, against the arena's
+	 * physical range. The door sits below the
+	 * in_interrupt() delegation above, because
+	 * iscandar_bridge_call() sleeps; a deferred atomic
+	 * free reaches this door again in process context.
+	 * Ruled 2026-11-17. */
+	{
